  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>:</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">R</mi></math>&nbsp;be a differentiable function such that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math>, for all <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;is an arbitrary constant. Then",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
